\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\lang1040\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Praise to the Lord the Almighty
\par the King of Creation;
\par O my soul, praise Him, for He is
\par thy health and salvation;
\par All ye who hear,
\par Brothers and sisters draw near,
\par Praise Him in glad adoration.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Praise to the Lord, who doth prosper
\par Thy work and defend thee;
\par Surely His goodness and mercy
\par here daily attend thee:
\par Ponder anew
\par What the Almighty can do,
\par If with His love He befriends thee.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Praise to the Lord, who, when 
\par Tempest their warfare are waging,
\par Who, when the elements madly 
\par around thee are raging,
\par Biddeth them cease 
\par Turneth their weary to fury to peace,
\par Whirlwinds and waters assuaging.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Praise to the Lord, who when
\par  darkness of sin is abounding
\par Who, when the godless do triumph, 
\par all virtue  confounding,
\par Sheddeth His light, 
\par Chaseth the horrors of night,
\par Saints with His mercy surrounding.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. Praise to the Lord! O let all that is 
\par in me adore Him!
\par All that hath life and breath, 
\par come now with praises before Him!
\par Let the Amen 
\par Sound from His people again:
\par Gladly for aye we adore Him.   
\par                                  Amen.
\par \lang1033\f1 
\par \cf1\lang1040\ul\b\f2\fs16 
\par }

